  "description": "Lightweight SVG icon support for Avalonia. Three components: SvgSource (IImage), SvgIcon (TemplatedControl with Foreground / Background / StrokeWidth), and the {z:Svg uri} markup extension. Pairs with ZXUI.Svg.Core for parsing + SkiaSharp rendering. Zero external dependencies beyond Avalonia (11+) and ZXUI.Svg.Core. Target framework: net10.0.",
  "id": "ZXUI.Svg",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-08T07:52:43.39Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "WokHbt04Lm37fKgFkx8yTRmUISLKPcJKzIusp/YabJGElkp+YA492q49W44/DRxbOolJG645/e9RsqIYqEiDaQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 28866,
  "published": "2026-10-08T07:02:52.133Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1 ——\n- 修复图标显示不全：新增 <path d=\"...\"> 解析支持（依赖 ZXUI.Svg.Core 1.0.1，基于 SkiaSharp SKPath.ParseSvgPathData）。\n  此前以 <path> 为主体的图标（软盘、下载箭头轮廓等）会缺失主体，只剩 polyline / line 部分。\n- 工程补全 TargetFramework / ImplicitUsings，可直接 dotnet pack。\n\n首发版 —— Avalonia 轻量矢量图标库，基于 Avalonia.Media.StreamGeometry + System.Xml.Linq 自实现。\n\n提供三件套：\n- SvgSource : IImage —— SVG 数据 + 解析缓存，能塞到 Image.Source / ImageBrush\n- SvgIcon : TemplatedControl —— 真实控件，进 Content 区，叠加 Foreground / Background / StrokeWidth 视觉覆盖\n- {z:Svg uri} 标记扩展 —— XAML 简写\n\n支持 SVG 子集：path / polyline / polygon / line + viewBox + stroke 属性。ZXUI 设计标准：尺寸 mini 12 / small 16 / regular 20 / large 24，描边 light 1 / regular 2 / bold 3。",
